1
00:01:05,300 --> 00:01:08,980
=When the Lights Rise=
=Episode 1=

2
00:01:16,340 --> 00:01:18,620
Xiaozhu.

3
00:01:23,940 --> 00:01:24,780
It's okay.

4
00:01:26,020 --> 00:01:27,300
It was just a nightmare.

5
00:01:28,020 --> 00:01:28,420
Who?

6
00:01:36,220 --> 00:01:36,860
Who are you?

7
00:01:37,980 --> 00:01:39,620
(Promissory Note)
800 yuan, 3% interest.

8
00:01:40,580 --> 00:01:41,420
Impossible.

9
00:01:42,740 --> 00:01:44,180
Xiaozhu would never borrow money.

10
00:01:44,180 --> 00:01:46,140
She'd never get involved
with people like you.

11
00:01:47,500 --> 00:01:49,580
Pay now, and we'll waive
half the interest.

12
00:01:49,750 --> 00:01:50,660
I told you, that's impossible.

13
00:02:01,100 --> 00:02:02,140
Either pay up,

14
00:02:02,660 --> 00:02:04,180
or think about what happened last night.

15
00:02:14,660 --> 00:02:15,860
Impossible.

16
00:02:18,340 --> 00:02:19,820
What's taking you so long?

17
00:02:19,820 --> 00:02:20,940
The party's about to start.

18
00:02:20,940 --> 00:02:21,860
Hurry up.

19
00:02:22,940 --> 00:02:24,340
Sorry to keep you waiting, Madam.

20
00:02:25,340 --> 00:02:26,380
Don't worry.

21
00:02:26,500 --> 00:02:28,300
I'll make sure this dress
is altered perfectly.

22
00:02:29,620 --> 00:02:31,900
Mrs. Kong has no shame.

23
00:02:31,980 --> 00:02:33,020
She's always following me around.

24
00:02:33,020 --> 00:02:34,740
Whatever I buy, she buys too.

25
00:02:34,900 --> 00:02:36,260
I just bought this dress.

26
00:02:37,320 --> 00:02:38,900
That's why custom-made clothes
are always better.

27
00:02:39,020 --> 00:02:40,980
Those mass-produced
department store dresses

28
00:02:41,300 --> 00:02:43,460
could never match your elegance, Madam.

29
00:02:48,750 --> 00:02:49,340
Don't worry.

30
00:02:49,620 --> 00:02:51,700
I'll make it even more
stylish and modern.

31
00:03:20,420 --> 00:03:22,780
You certainly work fast
and think on your feet.

32
00:03:23,700 --> 00:03:24,900
Since you've given me this opportunity,

33
00:03:24,900 --> 00:03:27,020
I'll make sure to give it my all.

34
00:03:28,100 --> 00:03:29,580
Are you done yet?

35
00:03:29,700 --> 00:03:31,900
I don't want to miss
the first charity auction

36
00:03:31,900 --> 00:03:33,780
and let that country woman
have all the attention.

37
00:03:34,260 --> 00:03:35,060
All right.

38
00:03:38,100 --> 00:03:38,620
Let's go.

39
00:03:39,420 --> 00:03:41,340
Let's see what Mrs. Kong does next time.

40
00:03:44,520 --> 00:03:45,500
I'm sorry, Mrs. Kuang.

41
00:03:46,360 --> 00:03:48,780
I left something in the room.

42
00:03:48,780 --> 00:03:49,580
How careless.

43
00:03:51,300 --> 00:03:52,380
Get it and leave through the back door.

44
00:03:52,640 --> 00:03:53,180
Don't let me catch you

45
00:03:53,180 --> 00:03:54,660
sneaking food and drinks at the ball.

46
00:03:54,660 --> 00:03:56,540
Don't worry. I won't.

47
00:04:07,900 --> 00:04:08,500
Drink!

48
00:04:15,100 --> 00:04:16,380
Only if you die

49
00:04:16,380 --> 00:04:17,940
can I live!

50
00:04:28,660 --> 00:04:30,060
Die!

51
00:04:36,100 --> 00:04:36,940
What are you doing?

52
00:04:37,860 --> 00:04:38,420
Let's go.

53
00:04:41,820 --> 00:04:44,100
Well, here's another one.

54
00:04:44,340 --> 00:04:46,780
Let's see what tricks you're up to.

55
00:05:11,380 --> 00:05:12,740
That's enough, Xiaozhu.

56
00:05:13,140 --> 00:05:14,580
Calm down.

57
00:05:15,140 --> 00:05:16,260
Xiaozhu, calm down.

58
00:05:19,380 --> 00:05:20,220
It's okay, Xiaozhu.

59
00:05:20,420 --> 00:05:21,420
I'm here.

60
00:05:21,660 --> 00:05:23,110
I'm here.

61
00:05:23,110 --> 00:05:23,860
I'm right here.

62
00:05:24,740 --> 00:05:25,390
It's okay now.

63
00:05:26,180 --> 00:05:28,420
It's okay. I'm here.

64
00:05:36,180 --> 00:05:37,940
(Xiaozhu, save me.)

65
00:05:38,260 --> 00:05:38,980
Come on, have a drink.

66
00:05:38,980 --> 00:05:39,380
(Help me.)

67
00:05:39,580 --> 00:05:40,420
Have a drink. Come on.

68
00:05:40,420 --> 00:05:41,420
(Xiaozhu.)

69
00:05:42,380 --> 00:05:43,260
(Save me.)

70
00:05:43,700 --> 00:05:44,940
(Help me.)

71
00:05:45,420 --> 00:05:46,300
(Xiaozhu.)

72
00:05:47,130 --> 00:05:48,940
(Help me.)

73
00:05:53,180 --> 00:05:54,860
(Welcome to hell.)

74
00:05:58,020 --> 00:05:58,940
I have to save her.

75
00:05:59,180 --> 00:06:00,180
I have to save her.

76
00:06:00,580 --> 00:06:01,580
I have to save her.

77
00:06:01,660 --> 00:06:02,700
I have to save her.

78
00:06:03,380 --> 00:06:04,180
Xiaozhu.

79
00:06:09,740 --> 00:06:10,460
Xiaozhu.

80
00:06:12,900 --> 00:06:13,540
Xiaozhu!

81
00:06:22,560 --> 00:06:23,220
Xiaozhu!

82
00:07:25,470 --> 00:07:26,580
Xiaozhu, she...

83
00:07:29,340 --> 00:07:30,380
Xiaozhu really...

84
00:07:30,380 --> 00:07:33,060
Do you know how much the man

85
00:07:33,820 --> 00:07:35,260
you two killed last night was worth?

86
00:07:37,940 --> 00:07:38,740
I need to go to the scene.

87
00:07:38,740 --> 00:07:39,490
I need to see her.

88
00:07:39,680 --> 00:07:40,390
I need to go there.

89
00:07:40,400 --> 00:07:41,140
You don't need to go.

90
00:07:41,400 --> 00:07:42,740
The Kun Society will notify you.

91
00:07:42,820 --> 00:07:43,860
Notify me?

92
00:07:44,780 --> 00:07:47,870
Well, what brings you here today?

93
00:07:48,190 --> 00:07:50,630
What brings our generous benefactor here?

94
00:07:56,020 --> 00:07:57,180
Didn't he inform you?

95
00:07:57,420 --> 00:07:58,140
What's the matter?

96
00:08:06,460 --> 00:08:07,220
This is...

97
00:08:08,700 --> 00:08:09,780
This is Mr. Dong.

98
00:08:11,170 --> 00:08:12,100
My condolences.

99
00:08:25,620 --> 00:08:27,100
How does the Kun Society intend
to handle this?

100
00:08:27,280 --> 00:08:28,260
Boss Ren said

101
00:08:28,380 --> 00:08:29,380
whether to pursue the matter

102
00:08:29,420 --> 00:08:30,620
is entirely up to the Kuang family.

103
00:08:30,980 --> 00:08:32,020
In that case,

104
00:08:32,580 --> 00:08:33,340
as for my husband's death,

105
00:08:33,340 --> 00:08:34,780
there's no need
to trouble the Kun Society.

106
00:08:34,870 --> 00:08:36,820
Please convey a message
to Boss Ren, Mr. Jing.

107
00:08:37,520 --> 00:08:38,860
My father is currently in Beiping,

108
00:08:39,500 --> 00:08:40,740
so on behalf of the Kuang family,

109
00:08:41,000 --> 00:08:42,410
I thank Boss Ren for his condolences.

110
00:08:42,780 --> 00:08:43,280
Of course.

111
00:08:44,140 --> 00:08:46,100
Please let me know if you need anything
for Mr. Dong's funeral.

112
00:08:46,700 --> 00:08:47,660
I'll do everything I can to help.

113
00:08:49,870 --> 00:08:51,100
You're lucky.

114
00:08:51,580 --> 00:08:53,020
The police haven't taken any action.

115
00:08:53,100 --> 00:08:54,960
They'll probably rule it an accident.

116
00:08:54,980 --> 00:08:55,770
An accident?

117
00:08:57,020 --> 00:08:58,300
This was clearly murder.

118
00:08:58,700 --> 00:09:00,190
He assaulted Xiaozhu first.

119
00:09:00,820 --> 00:09:01,940
That's why she fought back

120
00:09:01,940 --> 00:09:02,970
and then tried to take her own life.

121
00:09:03,940 --> 00:09:04,960
That man was the real murderer.

122
00:09:05,270 --> 00:09:06,300
He got what he deserved.

123
00:09:06,540 --> 00:09:07,920
The killer took her own life.

124
00:09:08,420 --> 00:09:09,740
That's the truth.

125
00:09:11,140 --> 00:09:11,850
Move.

126
00:09:12,500 --> 00:09:14,300
I suggest you stop wasting your time.

127
00:09:16,020 --> 00:09:17,060
Wasting my time?

128
00:09:17,620 --> 00:09:18,220
Are you telling me

129
00:09:18,220 --> 00:09:19,760
to pretend nothing ever happened?

130
00:09:23,000 --> 00:09:25,580
Doesn't sound like you're here
to settle matters.

131
00:09:29,700 --> 00:09:30,620
And it's none of your business.

132
00:09:31,820 --> 00:09:32,780
What are you doing?

133
00:09:33,540 --> 00:09:34,540
Xiaozhu would never borrow money.

134
00:09:34,700 --> 00:09:35,900
And you can't threaten me.

135
00:09:36,240 --> 00:09:36,980
I'll investigate her death

136
00:09:37,020 --> 00:09:38,140
and uncover the truth myself.

137
00:09:38,520 --> 00:09:39,700
I don't want to get involved either.

138
00:09:40,550 --> 00:09:41,900
But you owe me money.

139
00:09:42,070 --> 00:09:43,300
If you die,

140
00:09:44,430 --> 00:09:45,350
who's going to pay me back?

141
00:09:50,940 --> 00:09:51,680
Coming.

142
00:09:55,940 --> 00:09:56,740
Madam.

143
00:09:57,140 --> 00:09:58,220
What brings you here?

144
00:09:59,380 --> 00:10:00,380
Mei Xiaozhu.

145
00:10:01,140 --> 00:10:02,100
Mei Yuhe.

146
00:10:05,020 --> 00:10:06,620
You sisters are really something.

147
00:10:07,500 --> 00:10:08,940
One seduces my husband,

148
00:10:09,060 --> 00:10:10,380
and the other covers for her.

149
00:10:15,820 --> 00:10:16,940
I'm sorry, Mrs. Kuang.

150
00:10:17,700 --> 00:10:20,100
I left something in the room.

151
00:10:20,260 --> 00:10:22,580
The body was found in the third-floor
dressing room of the Paris Hotel.

152
00:10:22,860 --> 00:10:23,780
The killer was probably

153
00:10:23,920 --> 00:10:24,820
a woman.

154
00:10:25,420 --> 00:10:27,700
What do you mean, Mrs. Kuang?

155
00:10:28,020 --> 00:10:28,780
I don't understand.

156
00:10:28,780 --> 00:10:29,700
Stop playing dumb.

157
00:10:29,980 --> 00:10:31,500
Li, take her away.

158
00:10:32,580 --> 00:10:33,940
There's been a misunderstanding, Madam.

159
00:10:33,980 --> 00:10:35,100
There must be some mistake.

160
00:10:35,180 --> 00:10:36,340
It's a misunderstanding, Madam.

161
00:10:36,340 --> 00:10:37,300
A misunderstanding?

162
00:10:42,220 --> 00:10:43,140
You know perfectly well

163
00:10:43,140 --> 00:10:44,220
what you two have done.

164
00:10:47,000 --> 00:10:48,660
Mei Yuhe, have you lost your mind?

165
00:10:49,260 --> 00:10:51,380
Did my sister really seduce Boss Dong,

166
00:10:51,860 --> 00:10:53,260
or was he the one
who tried to assault her?

167
00:10:53,260 --> 00:10:54,380
I'll get to the bottom of it.

168
00:10:54,860 --> 00:10:55,700
Until then,

169
00:10:55,700 --> 00:10:57,820
if you dare accuse Xiaozhu again,

170
00:10:58,060 --> 00:10:59,820
don't blame me
if I take you down with me.

171
00:11:02,220 --> 00:11:02,900
Let go of me!

172
00:11:04,380 --> 00:11:05,260
You?

173
00:11:05,860 --> 00:11:07,660
Why don't you explain something first?

174
00:11:08,020 --> 00:11:10,180
Why did you deliberately stay
on the third floor last night?

175
00:11:10,740 --> 00:11:11,900
And where did you go afterward?

176
00:11:11,980 --> 00:11:12,900
What did you do?

177
00:11:14,620 --> 00:11:16,140
She was with me last night.

178
00:11:20,380 --> 00:11:21,180
Who are you?

179
00:11:21,740 --> 00:11:22,980
I'm her creditor.

180
00:11:23,540 --> 00:11:25,340
I went to the Paris Hotel
to collect my debt last night.

181
00:11:25,380 --> 00:11:26,620
She ran as soon as she saw me.

182
00:11:26,940 --> 00:11:28,030
But I eventually caught her.

183
00:11:28,170 --> 00:11:28,910
Let her go.

184
00:11:33,900 --> 00:11:35,260
I don't care who you are.

185
00:11:35,380 --> 00:11:36,980
I'm taking her with me today.

186
00:11:38,060 --> 00:11:39,220
Until her debt is paid,

187
00:11:39,490 --> 00:11:40,390
she's not going anywhere.

188
00:11:40,510 --> 00:11:41,640
Who do you think you are?

189
00:11:42,220 --> 00:11:43,020
Li.

190
00:11:43,020 --> 00:11:43,820
Move!

191
00:11:45,070 --> 00:11:46,340
Just try making a move.

192
00:11:47,250 --> 00:11:47,900
Everybody, stop.

193
00:11:47,900 --> 00:11:48,740
Mei Yuhe.

194
00:11:48,820 --> 00:11:49,900
You've gotten awfully bold.

195
00:11:50,230 --> 00:11:52,220
Careful, Miss Mei.
That gun could go off.

196
00:11:53,680 --> 00:11:54,450
Madam.

197
00:11:55,540 --> 00:11:56,780
You're the one who gave me my chance.

198
00:11:56,940 --> 00:11:58,630
You recognized my talent and helped me.

199
00:11:59,100 --> 00:12:01,090
Thanks to you, I was able
to open this shop in Shanghai.

200
00:12:01,380 --> 00:12:02,660
I'm deeply grateful.

201
00:12:03,010 --> 00:12:04,580
I'd do anything for you.

202
00:12:04,580 --> 00:12:05,530
I'd serve you for the rest of my life.

203
00:12:05,850 --> 00:12:06,840
But this matter

204
00:12:07,620 --> 00:12:08,900
concerns my younger sister.

205
00:12:09,020 --> 00:12:10,820
No matter what dangers I have to face,

206
00:12:10,820 --> 00:12:12,260
I'll uncover the whole truth.

207
00:12:12,280 --> 00:12:13,080
Put the gun down.

208
00:12:13,270 --> 00:12:14,180
Bravo.

209
00:12:19,180 --> 00:12:22,660
What a marvelous performance.

210
00:12:23,740 --> 00:12:24,540
Who are you?

211
00:12:39,000 --> 00:12:39,830
Boss Lv.

212
00:12:40,100 --> 00:12:41,900
Congratulations.

213
00:12:42,180 --> 00:12:43,180
What's there to celebrate?

214
00:12:43,190 --> 00:12:44,550
Is this really the time?

215
00:12:45,400 --> 00:12:48,720
You're now in charge of all
the loan sharks in Shanghai.

216
00:12:48,860 --> 00:12:50,040
How could I not congratulate you?

217
00:12:50,170 --> 00:12:52,100
You certainly know
how to work the crowd.

218
00:12:58,700 --> 00:12:59,740
Where's the dead girl?

219
00:12:59,740 --> 00:13:00,820
She's outside.

220
00:13:01,500 --> 00:13:03,820
Were that girl and Boss Dong

221
00:13:03,900 --> 00:13:05,180
involved with each other?

222
00:13:06,860 --> 00:13:09,060
Whether it's your business or not,

223
00:13:09,740 --> 00:13:10,580
don't ask questions.

224
00:13:10,580 --> 00:13:11,820
Understood.

225
00:13:15,140 --> 00:13:16,180
What are you doing here?

226
00:13:20,900 --> 00:13:21,580
What are you doing?

227
00:13:21,580 --> 00:13:22,340
Boss Lv.

228
00:13:22,500 --> 00:13:23,940
Never let your hand shake
when firing a gun.

229
00:13:24,580 --> 00:13:25,460
Let me show you.

230
00:13:25,940 --> 00:13:27,940
You country bumpkin,
stop making a fool of yourself.

231
00:13:28,220 --> 00:13:29,100
Such a foul mouth.

232
00:13:29,740 --> 00:13:30,700
Maybe I should shoot you in the mouth.

233
00:13:34,020 --> 00:13:34,700
You wouldn't dare.

234
00:13:35,540 --> 00:13:36,540
Want to find out?

235
00:13:41,480 --> 00:13:42,140
By the way,

236
00:13:42,380 --> 00:13:44,220
Boss Dong's position in the Kun Society

237
00:13:44,900 --> 00:13:46,060
will be taken over by Boss Lv.

238
00:13:47,460 --> 00:13:48,220
Boss Lv.

239
00:13:50,340 --> 00:13:51,500
I was only joking.

240
00:13:51,820 --> 00:13:53,060
Why so serious, Sister?

241
00:13:56,780 --> 00:13:58,140
We have guests here.

242
00:13:58,900 --> 00:13:59,620
Sister,

243
00:14:01,300 --> 00:14:02,500
you should mind your manners.

244
00:14:04,620 --> 00:14:05,540
Take her away.

245
00:14:07,820 --> 00:14:08,700
I'll handle this family matter.

246
00:14:08,700 --> 00:14:09,660
Why should I leave?

247
00:14:09,820 --> 00:14:12,180
I already called Father
before coming here.

248
00:14:12,620 --> 00:14:13,980
He said this family matter

249
00:14:14,620 --> 00:14:15,220
is mine to handle.

250
00:14:16,700 --> 00:14:17,860
You illegitimate child.

251
00:14:18,140 --> 00:14:19,780
What right do you have to interfere
in Kuang family affairs?

252
00:14:25,820 --> 00:14:26,500
Get out!

253
00:14:26,740 --> 00:14:28,060
Let's discuss this at home.

254
00:14:28,060 --> 00:14:28,660
Lv Mengde.

255
00:14:28,660 --> 00:14:29,260
Get out!

256
00:14:30,020 --> 00:14:31,100
Just you wait.

257
00:14:31,730 --> 00:14:33,180
I'll settle this with you
when we get home.

258
00:15:00,700 --> 00:15:01,580
Miss Mei.

259
00:15:02,740 --> 00:15:04,340
Normally,

260
00:15:04,340 --> 00:15:05,580
since your sister killed someone,

261
00:15:06,220 --> 00:15:07,580
we should report it to the police.

262
00:15:07,840 --> 00:15:08,710
But considering

263
00:15:08,940 --> 00:15:10,260
she took her own life out of guilt,

264
00:15:10,660 --> 00:15:12,020
there's no need to investigate further.

265
00:15:12,740 --> 00:15:13,380
We've brought

266
00:15:15,230 --> 00:15:16,100
her body back to you.

267
00:15:19,940 --> 00:15:20,940
This matter

268
00:15:21,900 --> 00:15:22,780
ends here.

269
00:15:23,180 --> 00:15:25,300
What gives you the right to decide that?

270
00:15:25,540 --> 00:15:27,580
The forensic examiner and police
have already investigated.

271
00:15:27,860 --> 00:15:28,980
The evidence is conclusive.

272
00:15:29,300 --> 00:15:31,060
The truth behind it is rather shameful

273
00:15:31,060 --> 00:15:31,940
and would only invite gossip.

274
00:15:32,500 --> 00:15:33,940
For your sister's reputation,

275
00:15:34,220 --> 00:15:35,420
you'd better keep quiet.

276
00:15:36,220 --> 00:15:37,020
Of course,

277
00:15:37,260 --> 00:15:38,780
we'll also come up with

278
00:15:39,260 --> 00:15:40,940
a more respectable explanation
for the public.

279
00:15:43,540 --> 00:15:46,660
This is a little something from me.

280
00:15:47,660 --> 00:15:48,780
Use it to arrange her funeral.

281
00:16:09,410 --> 00:16:10,020
Get out!

282
00:16:18,650 --> 00:16:21,420
♪Neon lights shimmer across my body♪

283
00:16:21,560 --> 00:16:24,990
♪Like the dazzling glory of rhinestones♪

284
00:16:25,040 --> 00:16:29,750
♪My high heels click
through the dazzling city♪

285
00:16:32,160 --> 00:16:35,070
♪Every step is drenched in blood♪

286
00:16:35,080 --> 00:16:36,820
♪Into their wineglasses, they pour♪

287
00:16:36,820 --> 00:16:39,130
♪A word or two of lies♪

288
00:16:39,580 --> 00:16:41,190
♪And tell me♪

289
00:16:41,190 --> 00:16:42,490
♪Come on, smile♪

290
00:16:42,490 --> 00:16:44,170
♪Don't ask why♪

291
00:16:45,280 --> 00:16:48,630
♪But I can taste the metal♪

292
00:16:48,640 --> 00:16:51,990
♪Beneath the cold,
sickly sweet champagne♪

293
00:16:52,000 --> 00:16:53,390
♪I once saw an angel♪

294
00:16:53,710 --> 00:16:57,790
♪Whose wings were broken amid applause♪

295
00:16:59,520 --> 00:17:00,760
♪If this is♪

296
00:17:00,760 --> 00:17:03,180
♪What you call salvation♪

297
00:17:03,190 --> 00:17:06,500
♪Then I'd rather bear my wounds♪

298
00:17:06,850 --> 00:17:11,900
♪And watch the city lights rise♪

299
00:17:12,000 --> 00:17:15,230
♪Like blades cutting through the light♪
